---
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import portrait from "../assets/iceland_portrait.webp";
---

<section class="px-5 md:px-12 pt-16 md:pt-28">
  <SectionHeader id="about" index="04" title="ABOUT" meta="VENICE, CA" />

  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1280px] md:flex md:items-center md:gap-14">
    <div class="flex justify-center md:block md:w-[380px] lg:w-[420px] md:shrink-0">
      <div
        class="w-fit overflow-hidden border border-encore-line mb-3 mr-3 shadow-[8px_8px_0_0_theme(colors.encore.accent)] md:w-full"
      >
        <Image
          src={portrait}
          alt="Adrian Cacho in Iceland"
          class="block max-h-[40vh] w-auto h-auto md:max-h-none md:w-full md:h-[560px] md:object-cover md:object-top md:aspect-square lg:aspect-auto"
          widths={[240, 390, 840]}
          sizes="(min-width: 768px) 420px, 240px"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 text-center md:pt-0 md:text-left md:min-w-0 md:flex-1 md:max-w-[820px]">
      <p
        class="font-grotesk font-medium text-encore-fg text-lg md:text-2xl leading-[1.5] m-0"
      >
        I build software you can see. Lately that's agentic AI: TwelveLabs'
        agentic video editor, and MCP servers, agent tools and evals as First
        Resonance's first AI engineer. Before that, the platforms behind
        immersive tech: <a
          href="https://blocks.glass"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-encore-accent no-underline hover:text-encore-fg transition-colors"
          >blocks.glass</a
        >, the first hologram CMS, serving 100,000+ assets, and the 3D pipeline
        Snap acquired with Vertebrae.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-0 h-px bg-encore-line my-6 md:my-8" />

      <p
        class="font-inter text-encore-dim text-base md:text-[17px] leading-[1.7] m-0"
      >
        For eight years I've moved between the codebase and the booth. I still
        VJ stages like <a
          href="/#shows"
          class="text-encore-accent no-underline hover:text-encore-fg transition-colors"
          >Proper NYE</a
        >, and it's the same work from the other side: systems that turn
        creative intent into something running live, whether the runtime is a
        render pipeline or a stage.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
